{
  "tema": 5984,
  "slug": "estar-a-precios",
  "titulo": "Estar a (not ser) for fluctuating prices and quantities",
  "subtitulo": "El dólar está a 18 pesos: a price that goes up and down.",
  "foto": "t06.jpg",
  "regla": "For prices and quantities that fluctuate, use estar + a: el kilo de aguacate está a 60 pesos; el dólar estaba a 20 pesos.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "When you talk about **prices or quantities that change** (exchange rates, market prices, temperatures), use **estar** + **a**, not **ser**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "thing",
            "**estar**",
            "**a**",
            "price / amount"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "It works in any tense: **está a**, **estaba a**, **estará a**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "To ask: **¿A cuánto está…?** (_How much is… going for?_)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: prices go up and down like the tide, so they take **estar**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "El dólar ==está a== diecisiete pesos.",
              "en": "The dollar is at seventeen pesos."
            },
            {
              "es": "Un kilo de queso ==está a== ciento veinticinco pesos.",
              "en": "A kilo of cheese is going for 125 pesos."
            },
            {
              "es": "El dólar ==estaba a== veinte pesos el año pasado.",
              "en": "The dollar was at twenty pesos last year."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mañana el euro ==estará a== diecinueve pesos.",
              "en": "Tomorrow the euro will be at nineteen pesos."
            },
            {
              "es": "—¿==A cuánto está== el aguacate? —==A== sesenta el kilo.",
              "en": "\"How much is avocado going for?\" \"Sixty a kilo.\""
            },
            {
              "es": "El agua ==está a== dieciocho grados.",
              "en": "The water is at eighteen degrees."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
      "titulo": "The trap",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "pares",
          "lista": [
